      "bluesky": [],
      "hypothesis": [
        {
          "user": "maneh_petrosian",
          "date": "2023-04-16",
          "url": "https://hyp.is/9gs31txbEe2nbqsqb6VrTQ/www.jstor.org/stable/pdf/10.3998/mpub.9853855.13.pdf?refreqid=excelsior%3A62331f05a8a064ac6ab5044a9f0367b3&ab_segments=&origin=&initiator=",
          "text": "This is especially true about the second song that I've chosen since it's made by Armenian singers and the song is in Armenian. The lyrics are very nationalist and patriotic."
        },
        {
          "user": "maneh_petrosian",
          "date": "2023-04-16",
          "url": "https://hyp.is/7feRSNxbEe2xrUMVDQzHRw/www.jstor.org/stable/pdf/10.3998/mpub.9853855.13.pdf?refreqid=excelsior%3A62331f05a8a064ac6ab5044a9f0367b3&ab_segments=&origin=&initiator=",
          "text": "Basically it can create bridges."
        },
        {
          "user": "maneh_petrosian",
          "date": "2023-04-16",
          "url": "https://hyp.is/AslpmNxcEe2z5IvwCRiipA/www.jstor.org/stable/pdf/10.3998/mpub.9853855.13.pdf?refreqid=excelsior%3A62331f05a8a064ac6ab5044a9f0367b3&ab_segments=&origin=&initiator=",
          "text": "I had used read this part specifically while forming my thesis statement for my first paper. Relates to the second song that I've chosen as well, since it's also a nationalist song made for raising people's and especially soldiers' spirits."
        },
        {
          "user": "maneh_petrosian",
          "date": "2023-04-16",
          "url": "https://hyp.is/c0Ql5NxeEe2P8buzVr3fMA/www.jstor.org/stable/pdf/10.3998/mpub.9853855.13.pdf?refreqid=excelsior%3A62331f05a8a064ac6ab5044a9f0367b3&ab_segments=&origin=&initiator=",
          "text": "This highlights two ways in which this impact can be seen: through migration, where people physically move to new places and bring their music with them, and through technological mediation, where advancements in communication technologies allow music to be shared and experienced across different geographical locations.  (Thanks chat GPT)"
        },
        {
          "user": "maneh_petrosian",
          "date": "2023-04-16",
          "url": "https://hyp.is/gWDkgNxbEe2-68PygSvGhg/www.jstor.org/stable/pdf/10.3998/mpub.9853855.13.pdf?refreqid=excelsior%3A62331f05a8a064ac6ab5044a9f0367b3&ab_segments=&origin=&initiator=",
          "text": "Both of the songs that I have  chosen can be referred to as Nationalist songs based on this definition."
        },
        {
          "user": "maneh_petrosian",
          "date": "2023-04-16",
          "url": "https://hyp.is/YxC20NxcEe2-7EeJWSRf4g/www.jstor.org/stable/pdf/10.3998/mpub.9853855.13.pdf?refreqid=excelsior%3A62331f05a8a064ac6ab5044a9f0367b3&ab_segments=&origin=&initiator=",
          "text": "From my Media and Society class we have explored this topic deeply. And although these historical examples are interesting to read and give background knowledge on the power of rock music, I don't see myself using these parts of the text for my paper as my paper focuses on the 21st century Armenia."
        }
      ],
